Rule 3 (Padding length should be less than or equal to two times the input dimension)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int ⊎ tuple(int)} |= if v_2.len = 2 then shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) * 2 ≥ v_2[0] + v_2[1] else shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) * 2 ≥ v_2 * 2
